[resource]
script = ExtResource("3_8a88q")
sender = "Irene"
subject = "Ergonomics Check: Watch Your Eyes!"
body = "Hi,

Did you know that [b]59% of workers[/b] report that eye strain reduces their work productvity and effectiveness?

Here at Parallax, we want to ensure that you take care of yourself and don’t burn out. That’s why the Time Card app includes a “Take a Break” feature. Use this to pause your work, rest your eyes, and take in the world around you.

Remember, there’s a world outside of your screen!

Irene
[i]Sr. Wellness Specialist[/i]
Parallax"
avatar = ExtResource("1_d3dr7")
